{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/471931-demonic-torpor","id":471931,"title":"Demonic \"torpor\"?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-07T18:37:45-07:00","id":471931,"title":"Demonic \"torpor\"?","content":"torpor isn't necessarily what I'm looking for. I'm wondering if a demon can either A enter a torpor like state and sleep for a few thousand years (presumably in Demonic form) B die and get powered back on C some other option where the demon has been out of action for a long time but could be externally &quot;brought back&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T21:25:56-07:00","id":472135,"title":"","content":"The first option that springs to my mind is a suborned Facility. Demon puts herself in hibernation until her cult/buddies/plot brings her out of storage. It's not something that's likely to happen by accident. Presumably the demon has a really good reason to take herself out of circulation for years/decades/centuries at a time. A couple possibilities:<br /> <br /> - &quot;Wake me when X happens.&quot; X happens. The demon's allies wake her to respond to or benefit from X.<br /> - &quot;Wake me when X happens.&quot; The demon's cult/ring/Agency gets completely wiped out before they can wake her. X may or may not have happened, but the folks who wake her up have some other reason for doing so.<br /> - &quot;Wake me when X happens.&quot; X never happens, but someone in the waking world has decided that dammit, we need to wake her *now* to deal with an unforeseen crisis.<br /> - &quot;Wake me when X happens.&quot; The demon's buddies aren't around anymore, but the God-Machine has suborned the suborned Facility in the meantime. However, it seems not to have noticed the demon who already occupies it. The God-Machine brings the demon out of mothballs and gives her a mission that she's under no compulsion to complete...but it might be interesting to go along with its plans to see what happens.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T02:13:23-07:00","id":472444,"title":"","content":"I agree with Eric if it occurs it will be intentional even if it doesn't go according to plan. The 'how' is the fun part but stolen infrastructure is the easiest solution I can think of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T19:05:18-07:00","id":473634,"title":"","content":"A Gadget using a near-field effect of Frozen in Time, maybe a Lambda with Solitary Confinement.<br /> <br /> Additionally <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DtD pg 120</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Stasis: Time doesn\u2019t exist inside a bolthole. People<br /> (including demons) inside don\u2019t age, hunger, or thirst, which<br /> makes it theoretically possible to stay in a bolthole indefinitely.</div> </div> </div> </div>...If you're willing to have the memory of staring at a wall for thousand years or more. At the very least, a level 5 bolthole with the Trapdoor feature would be the safest place for a demon to go into pseudo-topor, as it would almost certainly remain hidden for the amount of time necessary.<br /> <br /> Remember even though your body doesn't age, your cover will degrade to nothing as everyone who ever knew you dies and turns to dust.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}